  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the crumbled Stilton cheese and stir until it starts to soften.",
    "Pour in the fried rice and break up any clumps with a spatula.",
    "Sprinkle the smoked paprika, dried chili flakes, black pepper, and salt over the rice.",
    "Pour the lime juice and soy sauce across the dish and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for 5 minutes, letting the flavors meld and the rice heat through.",
    "Add the chopped green onions and stir for another 2 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning if needed.",
    "Serve hot straight from the skillet."
